WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone is about to start!

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:15.950
<i>Beta.</i>

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:17.950
<i>Imprison him.</i>

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:20.150
<i>Yes, master.</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:21.930
<i>We're all aboard!</i>

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:22.990
<i>Coach, hurry!</i>

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:24.100
<i>Okay!</i>

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.100
<i>Coach!</i>

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:39.560
Coach Endou...

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.410
Our clubroom...

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:24.130
We can't go in...

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:26.870
Because of the soccer ban.

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.920
We couldn't change history back to the way it was.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:32.770
Even Sangoku-san and the others are gone.

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:34.910
We're the only members left...

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.470
Tenma-kun! Everyone!

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:39.280
Otonashi-sensei!

00:02:39.850 --> 00:02:45.260
What would Coach Endou have said to all of this if he were still alive?

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:51.390
No way!

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:53.360
Coach Endou is dead?!

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:54.590
That can't be right!

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:56.430
Not right?

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:58.810
But we all went to his funeral.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.160
A car crash?

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.490
No way...

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:09.060
It happened a month ago, on the day of the friendly between Japan and America.

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:12.210
That's a lie!

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.770
Coach Endou is still alive!

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.420
Tenma-kun...

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:21.330
Coach Endou... is alive...

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:30.000
He's alive?

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:31.310
Yes!

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.740
Okay!

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:35.650
If that's what you say, I believe you.

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.440
Otonashi-sensei.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:41.190
Do you recognize me?

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:42.050
Yes.

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:44.050
Fei-kun and Wondeba, right?

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:45.680
From the future.

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:47.950
You still remember them?

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:52.750
It looks like only events involving Coach Endou's life have been rewritten.

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.710
Huh? What do you mean?

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.650
History adjusted itself to be consistent with the situation.

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:03.340
It wrote off Endou Mamoru as dead in order to explain his disappearance.

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:05.490
Adjusted to the situation...

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:08.270
No matter how many times they explain...

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:09.390
I still don't get it.

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.150
I see...

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:14.290
Coach Endou is still alive...

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:15.870
Thank goodness...

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:18.150
But maybe not for long.

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:21.670
If we don't do something soon, this timeline will grow fixed.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.270
His death will become a reality.

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:26.950
Can't we just change history again?

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:31.730
It's very hard to remodify a timeline after it's already been changed once.

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:33.040
No way...

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:38.280
The only way to end all of this is by defeating Protocol Omega!

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:41.980
In order to rescue Coach Endou...

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:43.910
We have to correct history.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:46.630
Also, to bring back Sangoku-san and the others as well.

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:48.750
Sangoku-kun and the others?

00:04:56.760 --> 00:05:00.060
They got brainwashed into hating soccer?!

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:01.190
Yes.

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:07.570
According to Doctor Aruno, if we beat Protocol Omega, we may find a clue to changing them back.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:10.580
The soccer ban...

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.370
Coach Endou...

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:14.170
Sangoku-kun and the others...

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:16.170
Why are they doing this?

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.170
We have to beat them!

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:18.860
Tenma!

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:21.560
We have to beat Protocol Omega.

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:23.960
To do that, we have to get stronger!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:27.810
And for that, Avatar Armed will be crucial.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:33.020
An Avatar Armed that must be gained through effort instead of relying on the mutual resonance of space-time.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:40.960
Immediately after a timeline is meddled with, multiple identities of Tenma coexisted within parallel worlds.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:44.520
These multiple Tenmas resonated with each other, raising his power.

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:48.260
But now that the amplitudes involving Raimon Junior High have settled back down,

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:51.990
the parallel worlds have disappeared and their mutual resonance isn't taking place.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.120
No matter how many times they explain...

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.460
I still don't get it!

00:05:56.460 --> 00:06:03.740
As I mentioned before, the only way to achieve the real Avatar Armed is by raising your own power.

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:07.280
I'll learn Avatar Armed no matter what.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:09.520
Then we'll fight Protocol Omega and win!

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:13.720
Will we be able to learn Avatar Armed too?

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:16.580
That, I don't know. {Fei is only interested in Tenma  ;;}

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:23.350
But the more of you that are able to use it, the greater our chances of winning.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.120
In any case, we have to try.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:25.920
Yes!

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:30.140
Let's take back soccer and our real history!

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.640
Will we be able to, with just us?

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.360
We have to do it!

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:39.630
We're the only ones who know that this timeline is wrong!

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:41.420
That's how it is.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:45.130
Everyone here will combine our strengths to win!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.400
Shinsuke!

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:48.940
Let's train!

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:52.680
Okay!

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.220
So the ground is off-limits after all...

00:06:57.510 --> 00:07:00.800
Since they locked down the clubroom, it only makes sense...

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:02.520
Let's try somewhere else!

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.610
I thought as much...

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:13.560
We don't have a place to play soccer.

00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:17.770
But we have to get stronger and change back history.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:20.040
At this rate, we'll never get to practice.

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:24.680
I didn't expect the soccer ban to be this influential...

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:27.460
We can't give up just yet!

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:31.620
This situation is exactly why we have to bring soccer back!

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:33.460
For that, we need to practice!

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:35.660
But there's no place for us to practice to begin with.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:41.590
An e-mail...

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:42.670
From Gouenji-san?!

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:45.830
Gouenji-san...

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.240
It's been awhile.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.160
Tenma. Everyone.

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:56.010
Gouenji-san.

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:57.870
So you're the only ones who've come.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:00.560
Gouenji-san...

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:04.410
He put his entire life on hold to save soccer...

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:06.590
But even Gouenji-san must be...

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:17.150
Let's explain what's happening to Gouenji-san and get him to help us.

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:19.460
But I'm not sure whether or not he'll understand...

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:23.640
But I was in a different timeline from everyone else and I understood.

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:26.100
I'm sure Gouenji-san will also...

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:31.790
Otonashi-sensei, you met me and Fei before history got changed.

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:36.040
That's how you were able to accept the circumstances with relative ease.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:40.860
But Gouenji-san lived a timeline that's very different from what we know.

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:43.950
It may be difficult for him to accept.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:45.020
Oh no...

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.000
There's no other reason for why I've called you here.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:50.840
Endou...

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.840
I want to help you rescue Endou.

00:08:56.410 --> 00:09:01.100
We can't allow El Dorado to meddle with history any more than they already have.

00:09:03.590 --> 00:09:05.150
You know about El Dorado?!

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:11.460
Why haven't you been affected by the changes they made?

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:14.360
Quite possibly because of this bracelet.

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:16.270
The Time Bracelet?

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.840
It's the same one that Yuuichi-san had.

00:09:19.340 --> 00:09:20.530
My brother?

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:23.490
It does indeed appear to be the Time Bracelet.

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:25.480
You must be Doctor Aruno.

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:33.910
The Time Bracelet allows its bearer to travel through time, so it also acts as a safeguard against the effects of time paradoxes.

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:34.770
Why do you have it?

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:37.970
Supporter X sent it to me directly.

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:41.410
Along with a strange message.

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:42.730
Supporter X?

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:53.530
Back when I was Fifth Sector's Holy Emperor, Senguuji Daigo received a majority of his backing from Supporter X...

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:57.530
In order to discover children who wielded the power of the new generation.

00:09:58.140 --> 00:10:00.990
They're called Second Stage Children.

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:03.690
Tenma, you were one of its candidates.

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:05.440
Me?

00:10:06.150 --> 00:10:09.650
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:14.130
What are you up to, Tsurugi? Training?

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:16.410
Gouenji-san, take this!

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:18.430
The card game?

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:19.930
Let's do it!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:21.520
I'll go first!

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.250
Death Drop!

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:26.770
Nice shoot.

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:28.390
But I won't lose either!

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:31.390
Crossfire!

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:33.980
Nothing less from you!

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:36.100
I'm just getting warmed up!

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:37.450
Raimon versus...

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:38.210
Raimon!

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:39.450
Let's begin!

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:43.350
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:49.200
I know nothing about Supporter X.

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:54.440
But it was Supporter X who sent me this bracelet along with a message.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.420
What was the message?

00:10:58.430 --> 00:11:01.130
Wear this bracelet at all times.

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:04.230
By doing so, you will save soccer.

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:06.360
Save soccer...

00:11:07.380 --> 00:11:13.430
Does this Supporter X not want soccer to be taken away, just like us?

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:15.400
I'm not sure.

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:21.520
But it has shown me without any doubt that you are fighting to bring soccer back.

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:30.530
That's why I've come here.

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:33.040
To help you guys.

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:34.870
I see.

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:39.910
Even in our time, only a rare few are able to get their hands on the Time Bracelet.

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:45.410
This Supporter X must unmistakably be from the future, like us.

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:48.000
But why do this?

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:51.650
Would it have something to do with Second Stage Children?

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:53.110
I don't know.

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:58.390
For now, we must focus on beating Protocol Omega and saving Endou.

00:11:58.390 --> 00:12:01.300
And then, we'll take back soccer.

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:03.200
We'd like to do that, but...

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.710
It's okay.

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:07.940
There's still one place in the world where you can play soccer.

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:09.050
Where?

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:11.890
Use God Eden.

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:13.570
God Eden?

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:15.710
What sort of place is that?

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:23.750
It was a special training establishment where Fifth Sector selected children with the potential to become the ultimate players.

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:24.660
"Was"?

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:30.110
God Eden was shut down after its match with Raimon's soccer club.

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:32.590
You can still play soccer there.

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:46.320
You've gathered here.

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:49.460
Our commander is Alpha.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.330
Will you join me?

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:59.480
Call me anytime if something happens.

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:01.420
I may be able to help you.

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:04.650
Thank you, Gouenji-san.

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:28.470
It hasn't changed.

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:30.030
Everything's the same as that day.

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:33.540
So this is God Eden Stadium.

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:36.790
This is where Second Stage Children came from...

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.430
Tenma.

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:40.570
We found the balls!

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:43.090
Let's start training!

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:48.740
Doctor Aruno, how are we able to use Avatar Armed?

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:51.060
Avatar Armed, eh?

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:54.390
That's...

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:58.820
...a mystery to me as well!

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:05.290
While space-time theories are my strong suit, I'm a complete amateur when it comes to soccer.

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:10.450
I can't come up with the slightest idea on how to use Avatar Armed.

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:14.560
Anyway, I'm done sightseeing, so I'll be going now.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:19.250
Then allow me to explain!

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:20.260
Wondeba!

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:21.070
Tell us!

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:28.770
When a player and their Avatar fuse through Avatar Armed, they are able to move more efficiently.

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:33.010
Their speed and power exceeds those of the normal Avatars.

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:35.510
So how do we do it?

00:14:35.510 --> 00:14:37.290
I don't know the method.

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:42.110
But as long as you believe you can do it, you can!

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:43.470
Positive thinking, huh?

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:46.690
You need to listen to your Avatar's voice.

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:48.390
Fei, you know how?

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:08.870
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:13.390
For Avatar Armed, you must listen to your Avatar's voice.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:15.220
My Avatar's voice?

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:18.260
Concentrate and listen from within.

00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:21.200
Release all of your power in one go.

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:24.810
Armed!

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:29.950
He did it!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.480
Keep it up, Tenma!

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:39.600
It's hard...

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:42.860
Can't you explain it in simpler terms?

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:45.950
It's really more about you feeling it instead of understanding through words.

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:51.690
All I can say is that you must feel your Avatar, listen to its voice, and synchronize your feelings.

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:54.030
Synchronize our feelings...

00:15:55.590 --> 00:15:56.760
I'll try it.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:04.330
Sword Saint Lancelot!

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:13.740
Raising my energy alone isn't enough.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.150
Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:24.940
Focus my spirit into the Avatar...

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:32.340
No good...

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:38.460
Planet Guardian God Titanius!

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:40.340
And!

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:41.690
Armed!

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:51.070
Sengoku War God Musashi!

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:56.050
Hey there! Would you happen to know how to use Avatar Armed?

00:17:00.430 --> 00:17:03.860
I've gotta recall how I felt when I was able to use Avatar Armed.

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:14.420
Once more!

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:16.580
That's it!

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:18.260
Burn up those hearts!

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:19.880
Burst with passion!

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:23.980
Raise your enthuasiasm full slot!

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:33.000
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:41.540
Tenma, let me help you.

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:43.370
Thanks.

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:46.550
We can't forgive them, right, Tenma?

00:17:46.550 --> 00:17:50.500
How dare they take soccer from us when it's so much fun?

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:51.850
Fei.

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:54.530
Let's protect soccer together, Tenma.

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:00.640
Armed!

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:02.190
Armed!!

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:05.710
Will they be able to perform Avatar Armed?

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:04.040
Armed!!!

00:18:05.710 --> 00:18:08.690
I'm sure they will.

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:12.190
They've been able to conquer all sorts of troubles before.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:13.960
It's no good!

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:16.980
I can't use Avatar Armed no matter what I do!

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:18.160
What do we do?

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.610
I wish you'd teach it to us in more concrete terms.

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:22.090
You could say that again.

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:38.570
Protocol Omega 2.0?!

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:40.460
Not so.

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:41.360
We are...

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:42.710
Einam!

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:44.150
Reiza.

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:45.580
Quarth.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:47.040
Zanou.

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:48.430
Gaura.

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:52.480
We obey Alpha as Team A5.

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:54.430
Team A5?

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:57.240
The elite five, huh?

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:02.180
You mean to train on this island and learn Avatar Armed?

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.350
That's laughable.

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:12.250
Before you waste your time with futile effort, we'll teach you to be as obedient as the rest of your friends.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.330
Obedient?

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:20.510
We'll show you a world of hurt and make you never want to play soccer again.

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:23.120
A soccer battle, huh?

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:24.290
Okay!

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:26.890
Then if we win, turn history back to the way it was!

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:28.810
Give us back Coach Endou!

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:32.460
And take off the mind control you have on the rest of our team!

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:34.010
Very well.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.170
But only if you win.

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:39.080
Should you be making such promises?

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:42.450
I don't intend to keep them.

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:45.600
Okay then!

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:50.860
Clark Wonderbat-sama, the greatest coach of all time, will announce the five in the starting lineup!

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.190
First up, Fei!

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:54.040
Wait.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.420
I'm dropping out.

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:05.710
Don't you think it's strange that only five members of Protocol Omega are here when they've usually worked as a full team until now?

00:20:06.090 --> 00:20:09.970
It's possible that El Dorado didn't order them to come here.

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:12.690
It's not unthinkable.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.690
Then why are they here?

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:16.950
I don't know their reasons.

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:20.430
But this could be our chance.

00:20:20.430 --> 00:20:21.180
Chance?

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:25.650
There's no better way to train for Avatar Armed than through a real battle.

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:44.570
If I keep bringing out my Avatar, it's sure to work...

00:20:46.230 --> 00:20:47.230
Let's go.

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:55.350
What?

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:58.490
This battle has nothing to do with changing history.

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:03.440
The mutual resonance you're hoping for won't be happening.

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:07.010
Therefore, the possibility of you achieving Avatar Armed is zero.

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:09.310
You've already lost before you even began.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:12.660
Shoot Command 06!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:14.750
<Plasma Ball>

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:28.410
Planet Guardian God Titanius!

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:32.720
Majin The Hand!

00:21:47.430 --> 00:21:50.620
Normal Avatars aren't enough!

00:23:22.700 --> 00:23:24.860
Someone unexpected comes to help us!

00:23:24.860 --> 00:23:28.830
Now is the time to think about what we wish to protect and get stronger!

00:23:28.830 --> 00:23:31.960
Next, Master It! Avatar Armed!!

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:33.970
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:43.380 --> 00:23:47.610
The Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone's proverb today is...

00:23:50.660 --> 00:23:54.810
Nothing is impossible when they've been able to conquer all sorts of troubles before!

00:23:54.810 --> 00:23:55.870
That's all!
